msgstr ""
"Egenschappen vun de hele Siet ännern."
"<p>Opstunns kannst Du de Papeergrött, -utrichten, Kopp- un Footreeg-Grötten, un de Striepeninstellen ännern.</p>"

#. +> trunk
#: part/KWView.cpp:254
msgid "Make inline"
msgstr "Inbetten"

#. +> trunk
#: part/KWView.cpp:255
msgid "Convert current frame to an inline frame"
msgstr "Aktuell Rahmen na en inbett Rahmen ümwanneln."

#. +> trunk
#: part/KWView.cpp:256
msgid ""
"Convert the current frame to an inline frame.<br>"
"<br>"
"Place the inline frame within the text at the point nearest to the frames current position."
msgstr ""
"Aktuell Rahmen na en inbett Rahmen ümwanneln.<br>"
"<br>"
"Den inbett Rahmen binnen den Text neegst em sien aktuell Positschoon platzeren."

#. +> trunk
#: part/KWView.cpp:268
msgid "Sentence, word and letter counts for this document"
msgstr "Sätz-, Wöör- un Bookstaventeller för dit Dokment"

#. +> trunk
#: part/KWView.cpp:269
msgid ""
"Information on the number of letters, words, syllables and sentences for this document."
"<p>Evaluates readability using the Flesch reading score.</p>"
msgstr ""
"Informatschonen över de Tall vun Bookstaven, Wöör, Sülven un Sätz binnen dit Dokment."
"<p>Reekt de Leesborkeit na de \"Flesch-Beweerten\" ut.</p>"

#. +> trunk
#: part/KWView.cpp:272
msgid "Show Rulers"
msgstr "Linealen wiesen"

#. +> trunk
#: part/KWView.cpp:274
msgid "Shows or hides rulers"
msgstr "Wiest oder verstickt de Linealen"

#. +> trunk
#: part/KWView.cpp:275
msgid ""
"The rulers are the white measuring spaces top and left of the document. The rulers show the position and width of pages and of frames and can be used to position tabulators among others."
"<p>Uncheck this to disable the rulers from being displayed.</p>"
msgstr ""
"De Linealen sünd de witt Maatafstänn baven un linkerhand dat Dokment. De Linealen wiest de Positschoon un Breed vun Sieden un Rahmens un laat sik för't Positschoneren vun Tabulatoren bruken."
"<p>Maak dit ut, wenn Du keen Linealen wiesen wullt.</p>"

#. +> trunk
#: part/KWView.cpp:283
msgid "Delete Page"
msgstr "Siet wegdoon"

#. +> trunk
#: part/KWView.cpp:289
msgid "Formatting Characters"
msgstr "Formateren-Tekens"

#. +> trunk
#: part/KWView.cpp:293
msgid "Toggle the display of non-printing characters"
msgstr "Nich-druckbor Tekens wiesen/versteken"

#. +> trunk
#: part/KWView.cpp:294
msgid ""
"Toggle the display of non-printing characters.<br/>"
"<br/>"
"When this is enabled, KWord shows you tabs, spaces, carriage returns and other non-printing characters."
msgstr ""
"Nich-druckbor Tekens wiesen/versteken.<br/>"
"<br/>"
"Wenn dit anmaakt is, warrt Tabulatoren, Leertekens, WagenRetuurs un anner nich-druckbor Tekens wiest."

#. +> trunk
#: part/KWView.cpp:296
